perl-cross 1.6.4 ships no patch set for perl 5.42.3. The perl5-5.42.0 set
applies unchanged, so link it under the name perl-cross looks for. The
links are per-file because `find cnf/diffs/perl5-$version`, which
perl-cross uses to collect them, does not descend into a symlinked
directory.

diff --git a/cnf/diffs/perl5-5.42.3/constant.patch b/cnf/diffs/perl5-5.42.3/constant.patch
new file mode 120000
index 0000000..61f792a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/cnf/diffs/perl5-5.42.3/constant.patch
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+../perl5-5.42.0/constant.patch
\ No newline at end of file
